{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2888390/extras/ac357931db41a5ba186338ff38e88fbc.avif?t=1768346739\" width=1560 height=195 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2888390/extras/4d9733a7fa41e71efdd177eac2841850.avif?t=1768346739\" width=1560 height=488 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Build charming towns in the sky. Place, paint, and decorate cozy cottages, taverns, inns and shops, inside and out.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2888390/extras/776601ae07f3378d60c3214d58c6c9b1.avif?t=1768346739\" width=1560 height=195 /></span>Bring characters to life. Customize the appearance of every character and assign roles and concerns to shape how they speak and behave.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2888390/extras/55bbfb5cc10b86ac6e76edab4e4a1b4e.avif?t=1768346739\" width=1560 height=488 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2888390/extras/2b5242aca042a4943fcd34cbfbc094c2.avif?t=1768346739\" width=1560 height=195 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2888390/extras/a5ebbe92176f96abec14834f696a7275.avif?t=1768346739\" width=1560 height=488 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">One magic click, infinite stories. Instantly generate dynamic dialogue, personalities, and evolving relationships.\u2028\u2028Or handcraft each piece of witty dialog yourself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2888390/extras/3aa74614c02704ddfbbc2f128d20f9ce.avif?t=1768346739\" width=1560 height=195 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2888390/extras/4ab5fc4e0ce412b3409678ffe8978bee.avif?t=1768346739\" width=1560 height=488 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Storytelling through play, not code. Worldbuild and shape narratives as you create.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2888390/extras/ac4df778b7767178c740432b9914be91.avif?t=1768346739\" width=1560 height=195 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Share your village and explore others. Invite your friends to visit or collaborate in your world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2888390/extras/aaf2a9e7f3255d26001c4ba254db96b5.avif?t=1768346739\" width=1560 height=195 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">A small click for a small team dreaming big!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2888390/extras/5efba7060215b3ca52cd5a5228c9924f.poster.avif?t=1768346739\" width=1080 height=1920 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2888390/extras/5efba7060215b3ca52cd5a52